## 1.[admin] section
### 1.1 POST admin/register-admin [register]
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Nattachai",
  "lastname": "Wongsrimueng",
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### 1.2 POST admin/login [login]
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### status code 204 is pass
### 1.3 POST admin/forgot-password [forgot password]
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}"
}

### 1.3.1 POST admin/reset-password [reset password]
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "{{newPasswordAdmin}}",
  "resetPasswordToken": "{{resetPasswordAdminToken}}"
}

### 1.4 GET admin/users/me [profile] use token
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


